# M6 mode 3 (own games) with two virtual controllers: P1 on slot 1
# (index 0, the base world's map), P2 on a fresh slot 2 (index 1) starting
# in the first level; each save only sees its own player's progress.
size 854x480
# The first launch plays the intro: hold a key to skip it.
wait 150
hold enter 70
idle 400
solve
idle 900
key escape
key down 3
key enter
idle
key down 4
key enter
pads 2
pad 1 a
pad 2 a
pad 1 up 5
pad 1 right
pad 1 right
expect state join OwnGames players=2
shot 01-join-own
pad 1 a
pad 2 a
wait 50
expect state multi OwnGames players=2 views=2 | v0 p1 slot0 baba/106level (map) | v1 p2 slot1 baba/0level
wait 20
shot 02-own-2-titlecard
idle
p2 solve
p2 idle 900
p2 expect level baba/106level
expect save 1 baba 0level 3
p1 walk 1level
p1 press wait
p1 idle
p1 solve
p1 idle 900
expect save 0 baba 1level 3
expect save 1 baba 1level 2
expect differ p1 p2
shot 03-own-2
p1 press pause
p1 press down 3
p1 press wait
idle
expect state title
quit
